                                                "sense_id": "591ab6d4-cede-3538-9f5f-b983d202878e",
                                                "text": "to dot a landscape with cottages"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6131668-1743-434c-8009-e7c5d0a137fc",
                                                "sense_id": "591ab6d4-cede-3538-9f5f-b983d202878e",
                                                "text": "The switchback road to Diabaig - pronounced 'Jer-vague' - passes through some of the most exhilarating scenery in Scotland. […] With a final swoop, the road plummets down into Diabaig, where cottages are dotted across the slopes of a rocky semi-circle."
                                            },
